just your vehicle and your wholesale

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:18.240
supplies, and you handle all of the

00:02:16.440 --> 00:02:20.280
marketing from your cell phone. Number

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:22.480
two on the list is mobile dent repair.

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:24.720
Paintless dent repair or PDR is the

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:26.480
