00:03:59.520 --> 00:04:02.680
without paying for it entirely out of

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:04.400
your own pocket. Once you have the

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:06.160
skill, your entire shop can run out of

00:04:04.400 --> 00:04:08.120
your vehicle. This is a skill that is

00:04:06.160 --> 00:04:09.959
needed in the marketplace. Every dent

